@startuml
title Axiom MK0 - Sequenza fault UWB e arresto conservativo

actor Operatore
participant "Tag UWB" as Tag
participant "Anchor SX/DX" as Anchors
participant "ESP32-S3\nState Machine" as MCU
participant "VESC CAN" as VESC
database "Micro-SD Log" as SD

Operatore -> Tag: cammina davanti al rover
Tag -> Anchors: ranging UWB
Anchors -> MCU: d1, d2, timestamp
MCU -> MCU: calcola target_distance / target_angle
MCU -> VESC: drive_command limitato
MCU -> SD: log FOLLOW

== Degrado misura ==

Tag -x Anchors: schermatura corpo / multipath
Anchors -> MCU: misura assente o incoerente
MCU -> MCU: valida timeout e plausibilita'
MCU -> SD: fault_code = UWB_LOST
MCU -> VESC: speed = 0, current_limit = 0
MCU -> MCU: safety_state = STOP

Operatore -> MCU: reset manuale dopo verifica
MCU -> SD: evento RESET
MCU -> MCU: ritorno IDLE

@enduml
